// Move 4 to the left 🚀
[3, 1, 4, 8, 5]
```

**Pass 3️⃣**
```
// Move 3 to the left 🚀
[1, 3, 4, 8, 5]
```

**Pass 4️⃣**
```
// Move 8 to the right 🛑
[1, 3, 4, 5, 8]
```

**Final Array 🎉**
```
// Final sorted array 🎊
[1, 3, 4, 5, 8]
