## 🔍 Binary Search Algorithm
This algorithm finds an element in a sorted array using a divide and conquer approach. 🎯
```python
def binary_search(arr, target):
  low = 0
  high = len(arr) - 1

  while low <= high: 
    mid = (low + high) // 2
    if arr[mid] == target: 
      return mid 
    elif arr[mid] < target: 
      low = mid + 1
    else: 
      high = mid - 1
  return -1
```
