Write a PHP program to find the largest number from an array.
array = [10, 25, 2, 39]
This PHP program finds the largest number in the array by iteratively checking each value and updating the maximum if a larger value is found ⭕️
```php
$arr = array(10, 25, 2, 39);
$max = $arr[0];

foreach ($arr as $value) {
   if ($value > $max) {
      $max = $value;
   }
}

echo $max; // Output: 39 🎉
```

